{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Click, Summon, Battle \u2013 Conquer the Battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564710/extras/222.png?t=1741975595\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this fast-paced strategy game, every click earns you money! Use your wealth to unlock powerful anime warrior girls through collectible cards and send them into battle. Your goal? Destroy your opponent\u2019s base before they destroy yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Click &amp; Earn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generate money by clicking! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Challenge players worldwide and prove your skills! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story Mode</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an engaging campaign with unique challenges!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Unlock Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Collect card packs and summon unique warriors! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Deploy your fighters and outmaneuver your enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Destroy the Enemy Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lead your army to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 are you ready for the ultimate showdown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you game? by Victor_Natas</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564710?t=1741975595","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564710/97261ef68cb4e285a4ce0f713d5e731b1e2d15b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741975595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st